Package: oocolor
Version: 0.2.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: openOODA-tools <ops@openooda.org>
Depends: libc6
Description: COLOR CONVERTER
 Converts between HEX, RGB, HSL, CMYK, and ANSI 256 color representations.
 Capability-bounded openOODA utility with zero ambient authority,
 WCAG contrast audits, and native Model Context Protocol (MCP) surface.
